diff --git a/DOC/Methods-Extern.md b/DOC/Methods-Extern.md
index 17702cf5..895b3d89 100644
--- a/DOC/Methods-Extern.md
+++ b/DOC/Methods-Extern.md
@@ -304,3 +304,38 @@ Modes:
 
 Versions:
 The 7-Zip Lizard codec will be kept in sync with the current releases of Lizard.
+
+
+Range 06 F7 11 xx - encryption (proposed, Septima)
+--------------------------------------------------
+
+Full method ID 06 F7 11 01 - AES256GCM (AES-256-GCM + Argon2id)
+
+Standards-only authenticated encryption for 7z archives:
+- KDF: Argon2id (RFC 9106, version 0x13); password bytes are the UTF-16LE
+  password as delivered by ICryptoSetPassword (same convention as 7zAES)
+- Cipher/AEAD: AES-256-GCM (NIST SP 800-38D)
+- Pack stream layout: ciphertext || 16-byte GCM tag
+- Coder properties (little-endian integers):
+
+      Byte  0      props format version (1)
+      Byte  1      KDF id (1 = Argon2id v1.3)
+      Bytes 2..5   Argon2 m_cost, KiB (UInt32)
+      Bytes 6..9   Argon2 t_cost / passes (UInt32)
+      Bytes 10..13 Argon2 lanes (UInt32)
+      Byte  14     salt size (writer: 16; reader accepts 8..32)
+      Byte  15     iv size   (writer: 12; reader accepts 1..16)
+      then salt, then iv
+
+- Encoder defaults: m=262144 KiB (256 MiB), t=3, p=4; decoder ceilings:
+  m <= 2 GiB, t <= 64, p <= 64 (hostile headers must not demand
+  absurd resources)
+- The ID mirrors the existing F7 11 xx vendor range under the 06
+  (crypto) type byte. 06 F7 11 02+ reserved for future methods.
+
+Codec author: reference implementations only - PHC Argon2 (CC0/Apache-2.0),
+BearSSL constant-time GHASH (MIT), 7-Zip AES kernels.
+
+Codec plugin author: Septima
+- Source: https://github.com/superuser-miguel (patch series bundled with the
+  Septima Flatpak; proposed upstream via design issue)
